Mon, 08 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>
A soft case for Arturia MiniLab 3 Alpine White.</description><content:encoded><![CDATA[

      

          

            

                  

                  
                  
                      
                  

                  
                      
                          
                      
                  
                      
                  
                      
                  
                      
                  
                      
                  


                  


                  <a href="https://tlocrt.com/other/sewing/midi_keyboard_case/images/midi_keyboard_case_birdeye.jpg">
                    <img class="work-image"
                         src="https://tlocrt.com/other/sewing/midi_keyboard_case/images/midi_keyboard_case_birdeye_hu1427232435292066043.jpg"
                         alt="MIDI Keyboard Case image"
                         loading="lazy">
                  </a>


          

      



        <div class="work-details">

<dl>
          
            
              <div class="work-detail">
                <dt> <span class="label">Title:</span> </dt>
                <dd> <span class="value">MIDI Keyboard Case</span> </dd>
              </div>
            
        


            
              <div class="work-detail">
                <dt> <span class="label">Description:</span> </dt>
                <dd> <span class="value"> A soft case for Arturia MiniLab 3 Alpine White. </span> </dd>
              </div>
            




            

            

            

            

            



            

            

            



            

            



            

            
              <div class="work-detail">
                <dt> <span class="label">Fabric:</span> </dt>
                <dd> <span class="value"> IKEA curtains </span> </dd>
              </div>
            



            

            




            
              <div class="work-detail">
                <dt> <span class="label">Date:</span> </dt>
                <dd> <span class="value"> July 2024 </span> </dd>
              </div>
            

     </dl>

    </div>]]><![CDATA[<p>I had been on a passive lookout for a portable MIDI keyboard for quite some time. When I saw the beautiful Arturia MiniLab 3 Alpine White, I knew that was the one.</p>
<p>Since I wanted to be able to take it places and since <del>I had some curtain leftovers</del> its beauty had to be protected, I decided to make a soft case for it.</p>







    

    

    

    
        
    

    






<a href="https://tlocrt.com/other/sewing/midi_keyboard_case/images/midi_keyboard_case_top.jpg">
<img class="md-image"
        src="https://tlocrt.com/other/sewing/midi_keyboard_case/images/midi_keyboard_case_top_hu17303057390936199384.jpg"
        alt=""
        loading="lazy">
</a>

<p>The biggest challenge in the design process was figuring out how to deal with the protruding knobs and faders.</p>







    

    

    

    

    
        
    






<a href="https://tlocrt.com/other/sewing/midi_keyboard_case/images/midi_keyboard_knobs.jpg">
<img class="md-image"
        src="https://tlocrt.com/other/sewing/midi_keyboard_case/images/midi_keyboard_knobs_hu16581442209426891621.jpg"
        alt=""
        loading="lazy">
</a>

<p>After a number of hours of overthinking the design, I went with the classic messenger bag style and a sponge insert that goes over the keys and the pads.</p>







    

    

    
        
    

    

    






